#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:2
msgid "Python 动态模块外部通信方法"
msgstr "Python dynamic module external communication method"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:4
msgid ""
"本案例演示如何在工作流中通过 Python 动态模块将识别结果可靠地推送到外部系统，涵盖 HTTP 与 WebSocket 两类常见通信方式。"
msgstr ""
"This case demonstrates how to reliably push recognition results to external "
"systems through Python dynamic modules in the workflow, covering two common "
"communication methods: HTTP and WebSocket."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:8
msgid "组成与流程"
msgstr "Composition and process"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:10
#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:20
msgid "Python 外部通信工作流"
msgstr "Python external communication workflow"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:14
msgid "人脸识别模块：运行，输出人脸预测与身份信息（含 unknown 判定）。"
msgstr ""
"Face recognition module: Run, output face prediction and identity "
"information (including unknown determination)."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:15
msgid "边界框可视化：绘制检测框以便查看识别位置。"
msgstr ""
"Bounding box visualization: Draw detection boxes to view recognition "
"locations."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:16
msgid "标签可视化：在图像上叠加类别标签（身份名称）。"
msgstr ""
"Label visualization: Overlay category labels (identity names) on images."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:17
msgid "仪表盘展示：将可视化图像推送到仪表盘页面。"
msgstr "Dashboard display: Push visual images to the dashboard page."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:18
msgid "自定义 Python 模块：整理身份识别结果，构造消息并向外部服务 `url` 发送 HTTP POST；返回状态码与调试信息。"
msgstr ""
"Custom Python module: Collates identification results, constructs messages "
"and sends HTTP POST to external service `url`; returns status code and "
"debugging information."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:25
msgid "工作流定义"
msgstr "Workflow definition"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst
msgid "查看工作流 JSON"
msgstr "View workflow JSON"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:36
msgid "外部通信示例"
msgstr "External communication example"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:38
msgid "下面给出两种常见通信方式的参考实现，可直接复制到 Python 动态模块中使用。请根据实际需求修改目标 `url` 地址与消息内容格式。"
msgstr ""
"Reference implementations of two common communication methods are given "
"below, which can be directly copied to Python dynamic modules for use.Please"
" modify the target `url` address and message content format according to "
"actual needs."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:41
msgid "HTTP 通信"
msgstr "HTTP communication"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:43
msgid "示例：使用 HTTP POST 发送当前时间戳。"
msgstr "Example: Send the current timestamp using HTTP POST."

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:73
msgid "WebSocket 通信"
msgstr "WebSocket communication"

#: ../../source/case_study/python_communication.rst:75
msgid "使用原生库实现的最小 WebSocket 客户端，同样以发送当前时间戳为例。"
msgstr ""
"A minimal WebSocket client implemented using native libraries, also taking "
"sending the current timestamp as an example."
